Author: Muhammad Mohsin Khan
Created: 9.10.2026
# ==========================================================
# CalculiX GraphiX (cgx) FBD script
# Single element cube model
# Unit system: mm, s, N, tonne
#
# Geometry: 1 x 1 x 1 mm; Vertical axis is y-axis
# One face in each axis is fixed in the corresponding direction.
#
# Mesh: One quadratic hexahedral element: HE20 / C3D20
#
# Run from a writable working directory:
#   cgx -b cube.fbd
#
# The script exports the mesh and named node sets. Depending on the CGX
# version, the Abaqus-format mesh/set files are written using the set names.
# ==========================================================

# Corner points at Z=0
pnt p1 0 0 0
pnt p2 1 0 0
pnt p3 1 1 0
pnt p4 0 1 0

# Four boundary lines: two divisions per edge
line l1 p1 p2 2
line l2 p2 p3 2
line l3 p3 p4 2
line l4 p4 p1 2

# Create the base surface
surf base blend l1 l2 l3 l4

# Sweep surface through 1 mm in Z
seta base_set s base
swep base_set cube_set tra 0 0 1 2

# Mesh with quadratic hexahedra
elty all he20
mesh all

# Select all mesh nodes
seta all_nodes n all

# Create boundary-condition node sets
enq all_nodes bottom rec _ 0 _ 0.00001 a
enq all_nodes zfix   rec _ _ 0 0.00001 a
enq all_nodes xfix   rec 0 _ _ 0.00001 a
enq all_nodes top    rec _ 1 _ 0.00001 a

# Export mesh and node sets for CCX
send all abq
send bottom abq nam
send zfix abq nam
send xfix abq nam
send top abq nam

# Display mesh in batch graphics
plot f all
plot n all
